part registers
  tally 1
  note "Faktura+ registers (records/faktura-*.csv), semicolon CSVs no text loads (O:B-1). The rows the asks read: the sales of 2022 (lines 3-14), 2024 (29-44) and 2025 (45-72); the purchases of 2022 (line 3), the car (line 4) and 2024 (lines 13-25). Each invoice is known on its issue (or receipt) day: one version per day. The register's own VAT column is kept as a fact (vat_charged); the law's VAT is computed in business.tally."

